; Whisper edge reputation, as a Response Policy Zone.
; Every entry has a citable listing behind it. /edge/snapshot.json says what this
; build contained and how many prefixes each safety guard refused.
;
; This file IS the way to get the policy today. Transferring the zone from us needs a
; TSIG key, and while the per-zone scoping is built there is no way to request one yet.
; Fetch this file; your freshness is the SOA refresh below rather than NOTIFY.
